      "writtenOn": "2023-09-13T07:50:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we bond over LE, then separately perform a temporary BR/EDR pairing, we will end up with a persistent LE LTK and temporary BR/EDR LK. Do we want to remove the persistent LE LTK in this case?",
      "parentUuid": "0e482d61_1ddc6ead",
      "revId": "f8c20e81dc5a462546c8daa02d98cca4b64e4112",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
